  "description": "OEDRO floor liners are designed exclusively for 2019-2024 BMW X3 30i, M40i, and X3M models without a spare tire (NOT compatible with X3 30e). Engineered for a perfect fit, these mats provide all-weather protection, are stain-resistant, and are incredibly easy to clean. Restore your car's interior effortlessly and keep it looking brand new.\nFeatures\nUnmatched Durability: Crafted from premium TPE material, OEDRO mats are built to last. Their flexibility and heavy-duty construction withstand constant wear, providing superior protection for years to come.\nSleek Design Upgrade: Enhance your Car interior with these stylish all-weather mats. The unique design adds a touch of elegance while seamlessly complementing your car’s look.\nComprehensive Protection: OEDRO mats safeguard your vehicle’s carpets from dirt, spills, and daily wear, ensuring they stay clean and dry no matter the conditions.\nEffortless Cleaning: Easily wash away spills, dirt, and grime with soap and water. The mats dry quickly and leave no lingering odors, making maintenance hassle-free.\nTraps Dirt and Moisture: The waterproof surface traps liquid, sand, dust, and debris, keeping your car’s interior spotless in all weather conditions.\n2-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible for 2019-2024 BMW X3 30i, M40i, and X3M models without a spare tire.\nNote: NOT compatible with X3 30e",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
    "Made from eco-friendly TPE material that is odorless, durable, and flexible, offering long-lasting performance while remaining safe for family use and extreme temperatures.",
    "Waterproof surface allows quick rinse or wipe cleaning, while anti-slip texture and secure fit system keep mats stable and firmly in place during daily driving."
  ],
